          "text": "Description: On February 18, 2008, at 4:21 PM, a witness observed in the sky two white, round objects above a mountain range. The witness took a photograph. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon (see the investigation report). Slightly strange and lacking in consistency, no conclusion can be drawn for this case. This case is classified as C due to lack of information and cross-checking.",
